s":"Nallicheri Tyagarajan","x":"We also believe that increased automation and digitization will expand the buy for our business, as we invest and offer AI and automation-based solutions, the value proposition that we bring to our clients significantly increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/08/genpact-ltd-g-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"G 2018 Q4","e":"g","d":"2019-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nallicheri Tyagarajan","x":"This is a very unique partnership centered around improving user experience, not just cost savings, where we will deliver our composite suite of middle and back office services across multiple functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/08/genpact-ltd-g-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"G 2018 Q4","e":"g","d":"2019-02-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Edward Fitzpatrick","x":"We generated $340 million of cash from operations in 2018, down 5% year-over-year and lower our outlook for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/08/genpact-ltd-g-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"G 2019 Q1","e":"g","d":"2019-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ed Fitzpatrick","x":"So from our perspective, kind of maintaining our outlook to where we were at the beginning of the year is where we want to be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/genpact-g-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"G 2019 Q3","e":"g","d":"2019-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tiger Tyagarajan","x":"The market has validated our strategy as we have won significant deals during the last 18 months that would never have been possible without our experience capabilities leading to outcomes beyond cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/genpact-g-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"G 2020 Q1","e":"g","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tiger Tyagarajan","x":"A key element of the CARES Act by streamlining and digitizing loan application and funding processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/genpact-g-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"G 2020 Q1","e":"g","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ed Fitzpatrick","x":"The actions we have taken include, but are not limited to, a freeze on salary increases, rightsizing and active redeployment of resources throughout the company to drive improved utilization and reduce bench and close to zero travel and discretionary related expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/genpact-g-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"G 2020 Q1","e":"g","d":"2020-05-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ed Fitzpatrick","x":"As Tiger mentioned, given the many uncertainties surrounding the COVID-19 crisis, we've decided to withdraw our full-year outlook until we have better visibility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/genpact-g-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"G 2025 Q4","e":"g","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Balkrishan Kalra","x":"Translate AI and agentic investments into measurable financial outcomes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/genpact-g-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"G 2025 Q4","e":"g","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Balkrishan Kalra","x":"Demand for our data and AI expertise is increasing rapidly, with our investments accelerating our ability to deliver.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/genpact-g-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"G 2026 Q1","e":"g","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Balkrishan Kalra","x":"Genpact Limited's context-rich process intelligence, combined with Google Cloud's AI infrastructure, allows us to drive agentic transformation acro